  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0 - Added Streaming API (WebSocket) via CasperCloudSocketClient with 10 channels: account balance, block, contract, contract package, contract-level events, deploy, fungible token action, NFT, NFT action, transfer. Includes opt-in StreamReconnectPolicy (exponential backoff + jitter), Persistent-Session support, INetworkSocketEndpoint for runtime network selection, and 50 new tests. REST client Mainnet/Testnet properties now return INetworkEndpoint for the same pattern.",
